# Meridian Freight Desk
#
# Participants clone this repo and work in it, so this file has two jobs: keep the
# usual Python noise out, and stay out of the way of the things the labs tell people
# to commit.
#
# DO NOT add lab-*-record.md, prompt-check.md, .github/ or tools/bundles/*.txt here.
# Every lab ends with `git add lab-N-record.md && git commit` - the record sheet is
# the deliverable - and Labs 3 and 5 commit a bundle file and a check file too.

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# Test and tool caches. The suite is unittest and needs nothing installed, but
# people reach for pytest and coverage out of habit.
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/

# Packaging, in case someone adds a pyproject and builds
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# Lab scratch: raw model output saved to check the contract (Prompt & Context Lab 2)
# and the pasted-lines file from Lab 4. Neither is worth keeping or comparing.
answer*.json
answer*.txt
answer.delimited
six-lines.txt
fuel-lines.txt
failing-test.txt
exceptions.txt
prompt-*.txt

# Editors and OS
.vscode/settings.json
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
